  "description": "CR 120.1, 603.2c, 701.27a, 122.1: Flame Channeler transforms when a spell alice controls deals damage; Embodiment of Flame gets one flame counter per spell of hers that deals damage, even to two recipients, and removes one with {1} to exile her top card, which she may play this turn",
  "note": "bob's Shock at alice on turn 1 and the Bears' combat damage on turn 2 are no spell of alice's, so the Channeler stays itself. alice's Shock at herself transforms it, with no counter since the Embodiment was not yet there. Prodigal Pyromancer's ability damage adds none. Forked Bolt splitting 1 to alice and 1 to her own Bears, no opponent dealt damage, adds one counter, not two. {1} and that counter exile Lightning Bolt, which alice casts from exile for a counter back. bob's second Shock at alice on turn 3 adds none.",
